      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASCEND HIBISCUS (5) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (22.60) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CALLAHAN (2) turned in a better effort at Bendigo last start, finishing third behind Fairway Flyer (24.31) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Will give a great sight again. INDY GRANT (8) finished well back at Ballarat last time when a 14 length seventh (23.24) but back to the course now of his latest success. Should be in this for a long way. RITA PAIGE (1) is worth some thought after placing in an impressive time last start.",
